上海市一流学科建设项目(S1201YLXK) 邮箱(Email): DOI: 移动端阅读 196 12 205 下载次数 被引频次 阅读次数 引用本文 下载本文 PDF 引用导出 GB/T 7714-2015 MLA APA Refworks EndNote NoteExpress NoteFirst 分享 摘要 全文 参考文献 出版信息 相关文章 摘要： 换乘会增加公交车在换乘站点停靠时间的不确定性,从而可能诱发串车和加剧线路的不稳定性。针对上述问题,以常见的存在单换乘区的两条公交线路为对象,提出了利用车辆驻站为控制手段的双线控制增强学习模型和算法。首先,对换乘区进行了归类分析,明确系统运行的供需特征,定义了系统的稳定性度量指标;其次,以线路运行的仿真系统为基础,建立线路控制的增强学习模型,并给出对应的Q学习算法;最后,通过算例验证模型与算法的有效性。研究表明新的控制方法可以在双线单换乘区条件下有效防止串车现象的发生,线路运行稳定性系统的运能可得到有效提高,乘客的平均等车和换乘时间均有所减少。 关键词： 城市交通; 公交调度; 增强学习; 公交换乘; 公交串车; Abstract： Transfers will increase the uncertainty of dwell time of a bus at a transfer stop. Hence, transfers may induce bus bunching and increase the instability of a bus line. To solve this problem of a system comprising two bus lines with one transfer zone, we proposed a reinforcement learning model and a corresponding algorithm wherein holding is the only control action. First, we categorized the transfer zones, clarified the supply-demand features of the operating system, and defined the system stability indices. Second, using a simulation of the bus line system as a basis, we built the reinforcement learning model and presented the corresponding Q-learning algorithm. Lastly, the numerical example demonstrated the efficiency and effectiveness of the new model and algorithm. This study shows the following main conclusions: the new method can effectively prevent bus bunching on two bus lines with one transfer zone and improve the operational stability of the bus lines; the new method can effectively improve the transport capacity of the system and reduce the average wait and transfer time of passengers. KeyWords： urban transportation; bus dispatching; reinforcement learning; public transport transfer; bus bunching; 参考文献 [1]OSUNA E E,NEWELL G F.Control strategies for an idealized bus system[J].Transportation Science,1972,6(1):52-71. [2]BERREBI S J.A real-time bus dispatching policy to minimize headway variance[D]
